448	// Every path the pack has lived at, its current one first. The commit inventory is scoped
449	// to the pack's directory, so a pack that MOVED - one promoted out of a member's local packs,
450	// one renamed on the shelf, a skill that began at the repo root - has its first weeks absent
451	// from the brief rather than misattributed, which is the harder absence to notice (#2221).
