545	// The element's life before its current carrier. `born` is drafted at the oldest commit of
546	// the carrier it sits in TODAY, which is the moment of the LAST CARRIER CHANGE wherever a
547	// rule moved into a skill, a coded check became a declaration, or a rule was a prose section
548	// before it was a bullet. The search finds the earlier carrier by the element's own
549	// distinctive text across every path the pack has lived at; the birth moves there, and the
